<title>USA: Ashland names Paul Chellgren chairman.</title>
<headline>Ashland names Paul Chellgren chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ashland Inc said it named Paul Chellgren as chairman during its annual shareholders' meeting Thursday, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company announced its intention to do so last year.</p>
<p>Chellgren succeeds John Hall, who has retired.  He had been chairman since 1968.</p>
